# 56. PERFORMANCE INTEGRITY

Never allow a Commercial to artificially increase their performance.

Examples:

- One call = one call
- Confirmed = only when confirmed
- Interested = only when explicitly selected
- Activated = only after activation condition
- Active = based on actual Expéditeur state

Do not count dashboard actions as calls.

Do not count opening a prospect as contacting it.

